  "lede": "Your internal question bank, merged from the Claude and ChatGPT question lists. The first cards are your own 34 core questions, in the order you wrote them. After them comes every follow-up question in learning order: AI/ML history, transformers, how an LLM writes an answer, APIs, embeddings, RAG, agents, backend and deployment. When both lists ask the same thing, one card answers it and the other wordings are listed under \"Also asked as\". Every answer follows your Oil and Gas RAG project story.",
