        "alt": "Production layout from the user down: company network and Azure AD sign-in, private load balancer and NGINX ingress, AKS node pools for apps, ingestion and Elasticsearch, and private endpoints to Azure OpenAI, ACR, Key Vault, storage, Redis and PostgreSQL.",
        "caption": "**Everything stays inside the private network.** The cluster talks to Azure services only through private endpoints.",
